  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2-吡喃酮(N)的衍生物广泛存在于自然界,有强心、抑菌等作用。化合物 L 真空热裂解,经中间体 M 转化为 N。M 是具有一定稳定性和强反应活性的非环状分子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "data/stems/assets/problem-000030-figure-001.jpg",
      "alt": "原题图示:L→M→N",
      "displayWidth": 80,
      "caption": "(原题图示原卷配图)",
      "assetId": "asset-002782"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "利用该反应原理,起始原料 O 通过系列反应,成功合成 2-吡喃酮衍生物 T。O→R 的反应具有很好的立体选择性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "data/stems/assets/problem-000030-figure-002.jpg",
      "alt": "原题图示:O→R→S→T",
      "displayWidth": 80,
      "caption": "(原题图示原卷配图)",
      "assetId": "asset-002783"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n\\underset{(\\mathrm{C}_{17}\\mathrm{H}_{16}\\mathrm{O}_{2})}{\\mathbf{R}} \\xrightarrow[\\mathrm{DCM/MeOH,rt}]{\\mathrm{H}_{2}\\mathrm{O}_{2},\\ \\mathrm{NaOH}} \\mathbf{S} \\xrightarrow[650^{\\circ}\\mathrm{C}]{\\text{FVT}} \\underset{(\\mathrm{C}_{12}\\mathrm{H}_{10}\\mathrm{O}_{3})}{\\mathbf{T}} \\qquad \\text{备注:DCM}=\\mathrm{CH}_{2}\\mathrm{Cl}_{2}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "9-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "请写出 M 及 Q、R、S、T 的结构简式(如为立体选择性反应产物,需表明立体化学结构)。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000059"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "9-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "判断化合物 N 有无芳香性,并简述理由。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000060"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "9-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "请比较化合物 N 及 1,3-环己二烯作为双烯体发生 Diels-Alder 反应的相对活性大小,并简述理由。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000061"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "9-4",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "请指出在 Q→R 反应中,PhOH 的作用。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000062"
    }
  ],
